    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Add a handoff hop counter: refuse after N transfers. Trace the behavior.\n2. Implement `nest_handoff_history` as an option \u2014 collapse prior messages into one summary before transferring.\n3. Write a blocking output guardrail. Compare latency on prompts that would trip it vs ones that pass.\n4. Wire `add_trace_processor` to a JSON logger. What shape does it emit per span?\n5. Read the SDK docs. Port your stdlib toy to `openai-agents-python`. What did you model wrong?"
      ]
    }
